    <item>
      <title>Version 1.1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 11:35:14 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.1.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Quiet start and stop tones, five sets to choose from or off, with a preview in the settings.</li>
<li>Colour palettes shown as round swatches with their name.</li>
<li>Fixed: releasing Command a moment before the key sometimes inserted only "^" instead of the dictation.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
