    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 17:59:18 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1.0.0</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Transcribe an audio file from the menu; the text goes to the clipboard.</li>
<li>The pill follows the caret's screen and remembers a position per screen.</li>
<li>Fixed microphone choice, six colour palettes, settings with a live preview.</li>
<li>Fixed: the first dictation after a pause sometimes recorded nothing.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
